PROVENANCE — originated per-theme Lottie motifs (screencast-cut Phase 4)
========================================================================

These Lottie JSON files are ORIGINAL WORK authored by this project (generated by
`scripts/gen_theme_lottie.py`), so they are license-clean to bundle and
redistribute — OWNED, equivalent to CC0 for our purposes. They are the
licensing-clean way to ship a signature animation per shipped demo theme: we
author one motif per theme in that theme's palette, vet it expression-free, and
render it deterministically through the Phase-2 `@remotion/lottie` / LottieIcon
path. We NEVER bundle or redistribute third-party Lottie JSON — a user's own
file is read from THEIR path at render time (see scene-templates/LottieIcon.tsx).

default-orbit.json
  License: OWNED (original work). Theme: `default` (dark/premium).
  A breathing cyan ring (#22d3ee / indigo #6366f1) with an accent dot orbiting.
  Flat fills/strokes, keyframed rotation + scale, NO After-Effects expressions.

foolswithtools-spark.json
  License: OWNED (original work). Theme: `foolswithtools-brand` (pop-art/punk).
  A chunky acid-green star (#CCFF00) with a 2px charcoal (#1A1A1A) ink border and
  a hot-orange (#F5471D) core, spinning with a punchy scale bounce.
  Flat fills/strokes + parametric star, keyframed transforms, NO expressions.

Regenerate with:  python3 scripts/gen_theme_lottie.py
Vet with:         python3 scripts/lottie_ingest.py <file> --check-only
